## 🤖 Choosing Claude Models

Claude models come in three main variants:

- **Opus**
  - Most powerful
  - Best for complex reasoning and long tasks

- **Sonnet**
  - Balanced performance and speed
  - General-purpose usage

- **Haiku**
  - Fastest and cheapest
  - Ideal for low-latency tasks

### ✅ Key Features
- Large context window (~1M tokens)
- Multilingual support
- Supports text + image inputs
- Available via API, AWS Bedrock, Vertex AI

🔗 Docs: https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/models/overview  

